{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":35,"count":24,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L06-1-13\",\"会\",\"會\",\"会\",\"Vaux\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我不會游泳，你會嗎？","pinyin":"Wǒ bú huì yóuyǒng, nǐ huì ma?","english":"I can not swim, can you?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-13","sourceFront":"會","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我會游泳，可是游得不太好。","pinyin":"Wǒ huì yóuyǒng, kěshì yóu de bú tài hǎo.","english":"I can swim, but not very well.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我不會游泳。宜文，妳會游泳嗎？","pinyin":"Wǒ bú huì yóuyǒng. Yíwén, nǐ huì yóuyǒng ma?","english":"I can not swim. Yiwen, can you swim?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他會唱很多首中文歌。","pinyin":"Tā huì chàng hěn duō shǒu Zhōngwén gē.","english":"He can sing a lot of Chinese songs.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-05","sourceFront":"唱歌","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我會給你三天的藥。你要記得多喝一點兒水，要是發燒了，就吃紅色的藥。","pinyin":"Wǒ huì gěi nǐ sān tiān de yào. Nǐ yào jìde duō hē yìdiǎnr shuǐ, yàoshi fāshāo le, jiù chī hóngsè de yào.","english":"I will give you medicine for 3 days. Remember to drink plenty of water. If you have a fever, then take the red pill.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他說他會去看醫生，請我們不要擔心，如果他好了，就會來學校上課。","pinyin":"Tā shuō tā huì qù kàn yīshēng, qǐng wǒmen bú yào dānxīn, rúguǒ tā hǎo le, jiù huì lái xuéxiào shàngkè.","english":"He said he will go see a doctor and he does not want to worry us. If he feels better, he will come to school.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天我要帶一些水果去看他，也會跟他說今天的功課。","pinyin":"Jīntiān wǒ yào dài yìxiē shuǐguǒ qù kàn tā, yě huì gēn tā shuō jīntiān de gōngkè.","english":"Today, I am going to take some fruit to visit him and also inform him about the homework today.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個星期六是元宵節，妳跟友美會去看燈會嗎？","pinyin":"Zhè ge xīngqī liù shì Yuánxiāojié, nǐ gēn Yǒuměi huì qù kàn dēnghuì ma?","english":"This Saturday is the Lantern Festival. Will you and Youmei go to see the Lantern Carnival?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"友美說她想去，我還沒決定去不去。燈會好玩嗎？","pinyin":"Yǒuměi shuō tā xiǎng qù, wǒ háiméi juédìng qù bú qù. Dēnghuì hǎowán ma?","english":"Youmei wants to see it. But I haven’t decided to go. Is the Lantern Carnival fun?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我去年去看了，很多大人帶著小孩去看燈會，非常熱鬧，我照了很多相片。","pinyin":"Wǒ qùnián qù kàn le, hěn duō dàrén dài zhe xiǎohái qù kàn dēnghuì, fēicháng rènào, wǒ zhào le hěn duō xiàngpiàn.","english":"Last year I went to see the Carnival. Many adults brought their children to see the Lantern Carnival, and it was very lively. I took a lot of photos.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我週末還要工作，打算一下班就去看燈會。我們可以約友美一起去。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhōumò hái yào gōngzuò, dǎsuàn yí xiàbān jiù qù kàn dēnghuì. Wǒmen kěyǐ yuē Yǒuměi yìqǐ qù.","english":"I have to work on weekends, and plan to go to the Lantern Carnival as soon as I get off from work. We can ask Youmei out for the Lantern Carnival together.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L06-1-18\",\"快\",\"快\",\"快\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"她看書看得很快。","pinyin":"Tā kànshū kàn de hěn kuài.","english":"She reads very fast.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-18","sourceFront":"快","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"啊！今天是你的生日。生日快樂！","pinyin":"Ā! Jīntiān shì nǐ de shēngrì. Shēngrì kuàilè!","english":"Ah! It is your birthday today. Happy birthday!","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-09","sourceFront":"快樂","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"宜文，生日快樂！","pinyin":"Yíwén, shēngrì kuàilè!","english":"Happy birthday, Yiwen!","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"朋友常來找我，他們都覺得坐捷運來我家，又快又方便。","pinyin":"Péngyǒu cháng lái zhǎo wǒ, tāmen dōu juéde zuò jiéyùn lái wǒ jiā, yòu kuài yòu fāngbiàn.","english":"My friends often visit me. They all think taking the MRT to my house is both fast and convenient.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"鞋子都在一樓，我們到樓下去吧！九點了，百貨公司快要關了。","pinyin":"Xiézi dōu zài yì lóu, wǒmen dào lóuxià qù ba! Jiǔ diǎn le, bǎihuògōngsī kuàiyào guān le.","english":"All the shoes are on the first floor. Let’s go downstairs. It’s 9:00; the department store is closing soon.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"期中考快要到了，老師說我們可以去圖書館對面的大教室看書。","pinyin":"Qízhōngkǎo kuàiyào dào le, lǎoshī shuō wǒmen kěyǐ qù túshūguǎn duìmiàn de dà jiàoshì kànshū.","english":"The midterm exam is coming soon. The teacher said we could use the big classroom across from the library for studying.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 忄(heart) takes a 夬(decisive) leap → quick as a blink: 快(quick)."},{"key":"[\"B1L13-2-10\",\"圖片\",\"圖片\",\"图片\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個網站上的圖片很多，而且都很好看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L13-2-10","sourceFront":"圖片","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"A 圖(picture) on a 片(flat piece) is a 圖片(picture/photo)."},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-02\",\"贴\",\"貼\",\"贴\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"請不要把貼紙貼在教室的桌子上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-01","sourceFront":"貼紙","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我想要得到便利商店的貼紙，所以花了很多錢買東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-26","sourceFront":"花","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"張先生常幫太太買菜、洗衣服， 要是比太太早下班，還會把晚餐做好，真體貼","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-36","sourceFront":"體貼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我同學很體貼父母，經常煮飯、 做家事，幫了父母不少忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-36","sourceFront":"體貼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"妹妹：我希望將來找個又聰明又有錢 ，而且很體貼我的男朋友。 姊姊：妳的眼光太高了，恐怕找不到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-20","sourceFront":"眼光","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他雖然年紀小，但是對人有禮貌，也很體貼父母，是個乖孩子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-08","sourceFront":"乖","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:何小姐只是我的鄰居，不是我的女朋友，大家都誤會了。 B:你對她很體貼，不但常送她上班，還常陪她逛街，大家對你們有誤會也是正常的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-06","sourceFront":"誤會","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"除夕那天，大家都忙著打掃、貼春聯，只有弟弟很不合作，什麼事都不做。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-03","sourceFront":"合作","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"石經理對員工很兇，回家後卻能表現出溫柔的一面，非常體貼太太。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-31","sourceFront":"面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個民族都有自己獨特的習俗，像華人除夕貼春聯、年夜飯的魚不能吃光就很特別。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-33","sourceFront":"習俗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:我對何小姐是真心的，為什麼她一直不肯接受呢？ B:你應該更關心她、更體貼她，讓她知道你是真心愛她的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-13","sourceFront":"真心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這條路不平，有民眾貼了海報，請大家走路時要小心，以免受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-26","sourceFront":"以免","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家餐廳的服務生很貼心，只要客人一上門，立刻提供面紙給客人擦手。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-35","sourceFront":"貼心","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司的布告上貼著超市打折活動的廣告，感覺真的很怪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-08","sourceFront":"布告","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老謝溫柔體貼、聰明英俊，符合我結婚對象的條件，因此我答應嫁給他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-42","sourceFront":"嫁","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華人過春節時有個風俗，就是每戶人家都會在門口貼春聯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-43","sourceFront":"戶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-29\",\"顾客\",\"顧客\",\"顾客\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"筆電的價格和功能，都會影響顧客的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-27","sourceFront":"影響","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想要吸引顧客來購買價格高的商品，除了品質好，服務態度也很重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-34","sourceFront":"購買","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家超市賣的商品都是安全的，讓顧客買得安心、吃得安心，用的也安心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-02","sourceFront":"安心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"快時尚的概念，就是在短時間內提供各式各樣的流行商品，讓顧客有更多更好的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-21","sourceFront":"概念","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"儘管這次推銷新產品的活動辦得很順利，顧客的反應也很好，不過還是有需要改進的地方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-06","sourceFront":"改進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在這家網路書店購買商品，顧客得先匯款。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-07","sourceFront":"匯款","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一般購物網站都是等收到顧客的匯款後，才寄出商品的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-07","sourceFront":"匯款","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"購物網站會把常見的購物問題及處理方式放在網頁上，提供給顧客參考。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-03","sourceFront":"常見","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"過年時，著名點心店都會收到大量的訂單，甚至有顧客在半年前就下訂單了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-16","sourceFront":"訂單","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"顧客付了錢，賣家也交了貨，這樣子交易才算完成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-19","sourceFront":"賣家","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經理因商品售完而跟顧客道歉，並表示明天就會補上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-19","sourceFront":"售","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在處理那位顧客的問題上，餐廳的態度真令我失望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-30","sourceFront":"失望","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對顧客來說，品牌代表了對公司服務的印象以及商品的品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-07","sourceFront":"品牌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店時常在過節時舉辦降價活動來吸引顧客。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-07","sourceFront":"過節","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"做生意與其花大錢廣告，不如提高品質，讓顧客替你宣傳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-27","sourceFront":"廣告","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-1-43\",\"國王\",\"國王\",\"国王\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在古代，國王所說的話是絕對的，也是最高的命令。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-34","sourceFront":"命令","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國王命下面的人死，那些人就非死不可。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-35","sourceFront":"命","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"故事中的女主角吻了白馬一下，白馬就變成了英俊的國王。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-18","sourceFront":"吻","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-2-12\",\"掛號\",\"掛號\",\"挂号\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"看病以前要先掛號，再照號碼進去看醫生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-12","sourceFront":"掛號","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"病人得先掛了號才可以看病。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-12","sourceFront":"掛號","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"寄掛號信雖然貴了一點兒，可是比較可靠。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-47","sourceFront":"掛號信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L15-2-11\",\"辈子\",\"輩子\",\"辈子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"王先生這輩子沒結婚，他希望下輩子會有機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-11","sourceFront":"輩子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"為了給孩子幸福的生活，很多父母一輩子都努力地工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-11","sourceFront":"輩子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"有些人等待了一輩子，都等不到高升的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-14","sourceFront":"等待","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"不管追求夢想的路上有多辛苦，都是我們一輩子珍貴的回憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-13","sourceFront":"回憶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人一輩子都會遇到像沒考上大學、找不到工作那樣的挫折，但只要努力就有希望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-03","sourceFront":"挫折","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母不能保護孩子一輩子，得讓他們自己經驗一些挫折，才能培養出堅強的性格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-04","sourceFront":"堅強","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我伯伯說，讀書與做人同樣重要，也是一輩子的事","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-04","sourceFront":"與","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他把存了半輩子的錢都拿去做生意，結果生意不成功，錢都沒了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-22","sourceFront":"沒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人花大半輩子的時間工作，陪親人的時間卻非常少。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-35","sourceFront":"大半","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人生短短幾十年，一輩子很快就過去了，因此應該活得精彩、過得有意義。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-12","sourceFront":"人生","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L02-2-20\",\"零钱\",\"零錢\",\"零钱\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個城市的公車司機不找錢，要是你沒有公車卡，就得自己準備零錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-20","sourceFront":"零錢","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L02-2-26\",\"滿\",\"滿\",\"满\",\"Det\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"錢老闆滿腦子都是工作，每天只想著怎麼讓公司成長得快一點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-26","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"小簡向很多公司自我推薦，經過了幾個月，最後找到了滿意的工作","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-14","sourceFront":"經過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我住的房子不大，也沒有很多錢，可是家人都很愛我， 讓我覺得很幸福、很滿足。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-17","sourceFront":"滿足","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在你的國家，成年的孩子常跟父母住在一起，還是滿十八歲就搬出去了？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-11","sourceFront":"成年","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我有一個幸福美滿的家庭，父母都很愛我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-24","sourceFront":"家庭","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老闆很滿意小陳的工作表現， 明年要請他當經理呢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-24","sourceFront":"表現","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在這家餐廳吃飯，只要滿兩千塊，就送一盤水果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-11","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那個杯子裡裝滿了水。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-11","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家印尼餐廳常常客滿，你最好先打電話訂位。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-23","sourceFront":"訂位","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家餐廳的菜又便宜又好吃，所以假日常常客滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-08","sourceFront":"客滿","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老師很滿意大家這次期中考的成績。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-37","sourceFront":"滿意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這次期中考，大家都考得很好，老師覺得很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-37","sourceFront":"滿意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在臺灣，孩子出生滿一個月的時候，有的父母會請客，慶祝孩子滿月。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-01","sourceFront":"滿月","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張太太上個月生了一個女兒，我寫了一張卡片祝福她，希望孩子快快樂樂地長大。 我的孩子滿月時，收到很多朋友送的禮物和滿滿的祝福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-11","sourceFront":"祝福","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"朋友的孩子滿月了，我想送他一份禮，祝福他平平安安地長大。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-21","sourceFront":"禮","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"照華人的傳統習慣，女人生完孩子就要坐月子，一直在家休息到孩子滿月。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-01","sourceFront":"坐月子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:這個玩具雖然可愛，但是不適合送給剛滿月的孩子，我們還是送紅包吧！ B:也好。送紅包也不錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-43","sourceFront":"也好","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在這家餐廳吃飯，要是滿兩千元，老闆就免費招待一盤炒青菜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-41","sourceFront":"招待","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-04","sourceFront":"行程","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-04","sourceFront":"歌仔戲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母要經常陪孩子聊天、玩遊戲，給零用錢不能完全滿足孩子的需要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-25","sourceFront":"需要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家餐廳的菜不僅平價，還很營養，常常中午十二點前舉客滿了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-11","sourceFront":"平價","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老闆收到一封寫滿越南文的信，辦公室沒人看得懂，非找人翻譯不可。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-18","sourceFront":"非","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"黃先生上班常遲到，也不認真工作，這樣的態度讓老闆很不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-21","sourceFront":"不滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一些家長對現在的升學制度不滿，認為學校不應該逼孩子寫那麼多測驗題目。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-28","sourceFront":"制度","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張經理今天的工作行程安排得很滿，連吃飯、休息的時間都沒有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-14","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"透過教授的介紹，我一畢業就順利地找到了滿意的工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-02","sourceFront":"透過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我打工的餐廳一到週末就客滿，忙不過來的時候，連老闆的叔叔都得來幫忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-33","sourceFront":"忙不過來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母送我的結婚禮物很珍貴，包含了他們對我滿滿的祝福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-04","sourceFront":"包含","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店滿足了人們購物的需求，就是不出門，也可買到各式各樣的生活用品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-08","sourceFront":"可","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣的芒果冰好吃得沒話說，連吃過的外國人也十分滿意","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-41","sourceFront":"沒話說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:我到底該怎麼做才能讓老闆滿意？ B:你太驕傲、個性太急， 做事也不夠仔細。總之， 先把自己的缺點改掉吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-28","sourceFront":"總之","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天客人跟著小溫去參觀工廠，也試用了新產品，一切安排都令他十分滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-24","sourceFront":"一切","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"花蓮那幾家旅館的雙人客房都客滿了，我們還是訂民宿吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-30","sourceFront":"客房","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"週末的時候，火車站的賣票窗口總是排滿了人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-32","sourceFront":"窗口","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"按照商品目錄的說明，消費滿五百元可以打八五折。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-24","sourceFront":"目錄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小王對農業很有興趣，家裡的倉庫擺滿了種田用的工具。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-17","sourceFront":"倉庫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一家餐廳要是受歡迎，就算把店關在郊區的某個小巷子裡，也還是時常客滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-05","sourceFront":"巷子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位客人在地攤買東西揀來揀去，最後又不買，難怪老闆滿臉不高興的樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-06","sourceFront":"揀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"教授的房間堆滿了各種書籍，本來就不大的房間感覺更擠了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-25","sourceFront":"堆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"元旦那天因為不少人放假，大部分餐廳都客滿了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-01","sourceFront":"元旦","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這處風景區非常有名，假日都擠滿了遊客。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-39","sourceFront":"處","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師不滿意我們這一組的報告，要我們重做一次。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-55","sourceFront":"重","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"本地社區的房子常被好奇的觀光客破壞，令人們十分不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-09","sourceFront":"好奇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從我辦公室隔著玻璃往外看，可以看見開滿鮮花的花園。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-09","sourceFront":"隔","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家旅行社有宣傳活動，所以裡頭、外頭都站滿了人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-42","sourceFront":"外頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每到重大節日，城市裡就到處充滿了歡樂的氣氛。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-17","sourceFront":"充滿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那棟沒有主人的房屋充滿恐怖的傳說，一般人都不願意靠近。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-31","sourceFront":"恐怖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Water 氵(water) pours until it fills the container level to the brim → 滿(full)."},{"key":"[\"B3L10-2-04\",\"坚强\",\"堅強\",\"坚强\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"父母不能保護孩子一輩子，得讓他們自己經驗一些挫折，才能培養出堅強的性格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-04","sourceFront":"堅強","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L12-2-08\",\"反應\",\"反應\",\"反应\",\"N/Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"不知道明哲今天怎麼了？老師叫了他好幾次，他就像木頭一樣，沒有反應","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-08","sourceFront":"反應","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"九二一大地震發生得太突然，不少民眾因為來不及反應，而被困在屋裡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-08","sourceFront":"反應","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"儘管這次推銷新產品的活動辦得很順利，顧客的反應也很好，不過還是有需要改進的地方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-06","sourceFront":"改進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 反(reverse) and 應(should): 反應 means reaction."},{"key":"[\"B3L13-2-19\",\"現實\",\"現實\",\"现实\",\"Vs/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個銷售計畫很好，不過得先解決相關費用和推銷人員等現實問題","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-19","sourceFront":"現實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:如果現在有一千萬從天上掉下來，那該多好啊！ B:你別再做夢了，趕快回到現實吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-19","sourceFront":"現實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"不管未婚或者已婚的人，在現實生活中都有需要面對的問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-22","sourceFront":"已婚","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Facing what is 現(appear) before you grounded in real 實(real) facts: 現實 means realistic."},{"key":"[\"B4L11-1-24\",\"典礼\",\"典禮\",\"典礼\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"開學典禮時校長所演講的內容又短又精彩，讓我印象很深。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-24","sourceFront":"典禮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這次畢業典禮，學校打算採用空拍的方式來拍紀念影片。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-03","sourceFront":"空拍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這對情侶找了幾位朋友商量，一起安排結婚典禮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-17","sourceFront":"商量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學校的畢業典禮辦得很精彩，讓我們度過了愉快的一天。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-18","sourceFront":"度過","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"之後\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 之(of) and 後(after): 之後 means later."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"休閒\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 休(rest) and 閒(leisure): 休閒 means leisure time."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"小姐\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"小(young) + 姐(sister) = young sister, a polite way to say 'Miss' to a young woman."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"手續\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Completing required paperwork by 手(hand) through 續(continuous) official steps: 手續 means process, procedure."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"福\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Praying before the sacred 礻(spirit) shrine with a 畐(roll of cloth) full of gratitude brings lasting 福(happiness)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"科學家\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A researcher devoted to 科(field) and 學(learn) inquiry within this 家(family): 科學家 means scientist."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"裡面\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"裡(inside) + 面(side) → the inside: 裡面 means in."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"規\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 夫(man) must 見(see) the rules before acting → 規(rules)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"郵件\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"郵(mail) + 件(item) → a mail item: 郵件(mail)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"降低\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 降(descend) and 低(low): 降低 means lower."}]}
